               <text>
                  <paragraph>acesulfame potassium, anhydrous citric acid, aspartame, colloidal silicon dioxide, D&amp;C yellow #10, FD&amp;C blue #1, FD&amp;C red #40, flavors, maltodextrin, pregelatinized starch, sodium citrate, sucrose, tribasic calcium phosphate</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20160602"/>
            </section>
         </component>
